        "created_at": "2012-02-13T07:18:28.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I read the ruling on damage increases, but found an iffy situation.</p>\n<p>Haka of Battle increases the <span class=\"bbcode-i\">next</span> damage dealt by Haka by 1 for blah blah blah. When used with Rampage (in the game we played the guy playing Haka waited), does he deal each non-hero target 5 + the extra damage and each hero target 2 + the extra damage, or does he deal the first non-hero target 5 + the extra damage, every other non-hero target 5 damage and each hero 2 damage? Basically, does that limited increased damage apply to the whole card, or the first instance of damage being dealt?</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:35:10.423Z",
