      {
        "id": 26113,
        "name": "TheJayMann",
        "username": "TheJayMann",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-02-21T14:34:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>According to the rules, no attacks are truly simultanious.  If something affects two or more targets at the same time, they are processed one at a time based on the players’ discretion.  In this case, the first non-Hero would have the bonus applied, but no more, as it was only to be applied to the next damage, and the second target would not get the effect.</p>",
